# EAS Build archives the whole git repo by default, but this repo also holds
# the Laravel API and Next.js frontend, which the mobile build never needs —
# and nepal-lms-api/storage/app/public is a symlink (from `artisan storage:link`)
# that Windows can't recreate without elevated privileges, crashing the upload
# with EPERM. Exclude both unrelated projects entirely.
nepal-lms-api/
nepal-lms-frontend/
